{"id": "q08", "mode": "ai", "detected": "deadlock", "solved": true, "by": "ai", "cause": "Each non-origin relay (parse, archive) forwards the message with a synchronous MsgSend to the next relay before replying to its sender. The ring closes when archive sends to ingest, but ingest is still REPLY-blocked waiting on parse's reply, so all three wait on each other."}
